    <string name="port_credits_body">Monoloco Saga by &lt;a href="https://github.com/KB-retro"&gt;KB-retro&lt;/a&gt; (Patrulla Retro) · &lt;a href="https://github.com/KB-retro/Monoloco-Saga/commit/%2$s"&gt;version %1$s&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Android port based on the static recompilations by elliotttate and contributors: &lt;a href="https://github.com/elliotttate/DKC1Recomp"&gt;DKC1Recomp&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://github.com/elliotttate/DKC2Recomp"&gt;DKC2Recomp&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href="https://github.com/elliotttate/DKC3Recomp"&gt;DKC3Recomp&lt;/a&gt; (MIT license), on &lt;a href="https://github.com/elliotttate/snesrecomp"&gt;snesrecomp&lt;/a&gt; (PolyForm Noncommercial 1.0.0), &lt;a href="https://github.com/libsdl-org/SDL"&gt;SDL2&lt;/a&gt; (zlib) and &lt;a href="https://github.com/libretro/glsl-shaders"&gt;libretro\'s&lt;/a&gt; shaders: Hyllian\'s xBR and CRT (MIT) and Timothy Lottes\' CRT (public domain); AMD\'s FSR (MIT) and &lt;a href="https://github.com/bloc97/Anime4K"&gt;Anime4K&lt;/a&gt; by bloc97 (MIT).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Unofficial free project, not affiliated with the owners of the games. No game data included: you need your own copies. Not for sale.</string>

