    <string name="quick_filter">Filter</string>
    <string name="quick_filter_tip">Sharp smooth keeps the pixels as they are. FSR upscales like modern games: clean edges without blocks. Anime4K redraws the picture with a neural network before FSR: M is balanced, 3D the lightest and GAN the strongest. xBR rounds edges, HD undoes the dithering, and CRT Lottes and CRT Hyllian imitate a tube television. Scanlines and CRT effects only apply with Sharp, Smooth and Sharp smooth.</string>
    <string-array name="quick_filters">
        <item>Sharp</item>
        <item>Smooth</item>
        <item>Sharp smooth</item>
        <item>HD (reconstruct)</item>
        <item>xBR (smooth edges)</item>
        <item>CRT Lottes</item>
        <item>CRT Hyllian</item>
        <item>FSR (AMD)</item>
        <item>Anime4K M</item>
        <item>Anime4K 3D</item>
        <item>Anime4K GAN</item>
    </string-array>
